Even though it may be a bit early, I want you all to know that my
http://rlnj.org domain now points to something. RLNJ stands for le
rolnai lojbo bo nelci jikca, the International Lojban Enthusiasts
Society. I just found the Moodle educational software and installed it
on the site. I'm still learning it and have no content up there yet,
but I think the system allows those who sign in to explore the site's
course functionality for yourselves and I can give you permissions to
create curriculum, not just join classes. Cool, huh?
-Eppcott


